    "breadcrumb": "BlitzAnalysiz[]",
    "content": "This is a non-comprehensive list of things I plan to work on when I have time.\nStratified sampling for Relative WR analysis to further eliminate the impact of different player populations to measure.\nAnalysis of historical data from early releases. For veteran tank nerds only.\nInteractive charts. The site is based on 100% static content: HTML \u0026 JavaScript files and PNG images. I need to investigate if I could use Javascript-based interactive chart-library such as chart.js at the site. This will be a major overhaul.",
    "description": "This is a non-comprehensive list of things I plan to work on when I have time.\nStratified sampling for Relative WR analysis to further eliminate the impact of different player populations to measure.",
    "tags": [],
    "title": "TODO",
    "uri": "/todo/"
